    "ordering": "attackcanceler, attackstring, ppreduce, accuracycheck, furycuttercalc, critcalc, damagecalc, typecalc, jumpifmovehadnoeffect back to furycuttercalc, adjustnormaldamage",
    "resetAndPersistence": "MOVE_RESULT_NO_EFFECT includes MISSED, DOESNT_AFFECT_FOE, and FAILED; direct no-effect resets. Cmd_ppreduce calls CancelMultiTurnMoves on a Protect gate, which also resets this counter. Normal non-Fury-Cutter move use has no Fury Cutter clear, so its counter persists; source has no gLastMoves/history read in Cmd_furycuttercalc. SwitchInClearSetData and FaintClearSetData zero the whole active DisableStruct; Baton Pass restores only Substitute/sure-hit/Perish/prevent-escape fields, never Fury Cutter. ClearFuryCutterDestinyBondGrudge also clears it for a used item and failed player run.",
    "lockAndRng": "Cmd_furycuttercalc neither sets STATUS2_MULTIPLETURNS nor gLockedMoves and calls no Random(); each manual Fury Cutter selection pays PP before accuracy. Accuracy, crit, and normal random damage belong to their later generic commands."
